# Netlify redirect rules.
#
# ONE JOB: every address this site answers at, other than https://stimpunks.world,
# sends its reader there path-for-path, so the site never answers 200 at two
# addresses with byte-identical documents and every canonical pointing at the one
# the reader is not on. Star Stuff found that shape on 2026-08-15, queering.earth
# had it the day its domain attached, and Cavendish had it again on 2026-09-15
# when it moved to cavendish.space: Netlify does NOT redirect an alias to the
# primary on its own.
#
# The `!` is required on every line. Each of these paths is a real file, and
# without the force flag Netlify serves the file rather than the redirect.

# THE SITE MOVED TO stimpunks.world ON 2026-09-23. It had been stimpunks.love
# since 2026-09-19, and that domain stays registered as an alias so a week of
# links keeps working. www and http on both domains are handled by Netlify's own
# primary-domain redirect; these lines catch the bare old domain, which Netlify
# would otherwise serve with a 200.
https://stimpunks.love/*              https://stimpunks.world/:splat  301!
http://stimpunks.love/*               https://stimpunks.world/:splat  301!
https://www.stimpunks.love/*          https://stimpunks.world/:splat  301!
http://www.stimpunks.love/*           https://stimpunks.world/:splat  301!

# The agent skill moved with the name. Anybody who installed it from the old path
# gets the new file rather than this site's 404 page.
/.well-known/agent-skills/stimpunks-love/*  /.well-known/agent-skills/stimpunks-world/:splat  301!

# The netlify.app hostname, ENABLED 2026-09-19, the day the first domain resolved.
# Before that it stayed commented on purpose: redirecting the only working
# hostname to one that does not resolve is a site that is simply down, which is
# why queering.earth kept its own commented until 2026-09-07.
https://stimpunks-love.netlify.app/*  https://stimpunks.world/:splat  301!
http://stimpunks-love.netlify.app/*   https://stimpunks.world/:splat  301!
